<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R17i was created by"@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R17i è stata creata da"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di R17 created: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale all'evento compositivo che l'ha prodotta. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R17 created: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the compositional event that produced it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@en .
